  "title": "Gary’s Turkey Burritos",
  "description": "Easy to make, these special low-fat burritos taste awesome! You don’t eat red meat, but love burritos? Well, you can’t taste the difference here. These are medium spicy, not fire hot!",
  "authors": [
    "Gary Bertagnolli"
